This package is an independent implementation of the wpa_supplicant and
hostapd control interface protocol. It contains no code from hostap, and is
not affiliated with or endorsed by that project or its authors.

Two things in it are nevertheless derived from the hostap distribution, and
its licence terms are reproduced below on that account:

  - The event names in wpa_ctrl/events.py and the BSS field-mask values in
    wpa_ctrl/client.py were extracted from src/common/wpa_ctrl.h. They are
    the identifiers and values that appear on the wire, so no other spelling
    of them would work.

  - Some example strings used as test fixtures in tests/test_wpa_ctrl.py are
    the sample outputs printed in doc/ctrl_iface.doxygen, used so that the
    parsers are tested against what the protocol's own documentation says a
    reply looks like.

